### [Negative][Vehicles] A 21-character plate (422 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/customers/{{owner.id}}/vehicles
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "licensePlate": "{{'A1'.repeat(10)}}1", "vin": "{{Vin}}", "brand": "Skoda", "model": "Octavia", "year": 2020, "mileageKm": 45000, "enginePowerKw": 110, "drivetrainType": "Petrol" }

?? status == 422
?? js (response.parsedBody.detail === "LicensePlate must be at most 20 characters.") == true

